From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tonrakun <tonrakun@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:02:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Kodama: Mob LOD tiers and reduced AI for mid distance

License: GPL-3.0

Assigns every mob a NEAR, MID or FAR tier from the distance to the nearest
player, with hysteresis and staggered evaluation. NEAR and MID mobs are always
active; FAR mobs still follow Paper's activation range. MID mobs choose goals,
targets and brain behaviors only every mid-ai-interval ticks and calculate new
paths at most every mid-path-interval ticks. Plugin AI API use, custom goals,
metadata, names, leashes, bosses, raids, damage and interaction keep a mob
NEAR; AFK players, fluids and falling mobs keep it from being FAR; excluded
areas are managed with /kodama lod exclude. Failures are reported to the
mob-lod FeatureGuard.

